WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.807
Let's reduce the module to five ideas.

00:00:02.807 --> 00:00:08.572
First, separate dataset organization from variable meaning and technical storage.

00:00:08.572 --> 00:00:12.442
Second, assess quality before trusting the analysis.

00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:17.982
Third, use measurement scale to decide which comparisons and summaries make sense.

00:00:17.982 --> 00:00:23.682
Fourth, remember that a dtype does not define analytical meaning.

00:00:23.682 --> 00:00:30.437
Fifth, make preprocessing choices deliberately and document why they are appropriate.

00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:33.632
Do not treat this as a list to memorize.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:38.427
Try to explain each idea using one example from a project you understand.

00:00:38.427 --> 00:00:45.927
If you can describe when you would use the concept, what assumption it makes,

00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:50.946
and how you would validate the result, you are ready to apply it independently.
